slstatus - suckless status
==========================
Small tool for providing system information,
Forked from https://git.suckless.org/slstatus


Modules
-------
- Volume percentage
- Wifi Connection
- CPU percentage
- Ram usage
- Battery percentage
- Backlight percentage
- Date and time



Installing
----------
Simply run
make install


Note
----
Some modules require scripts available at 
https://git.farajli.net/slcf to function properly.


Added patches
-------------
- https://tools.suckless.org/slstatus/patches/signals
